---
source: tests/edit_tests/work_tests/fields.rs
expression: value
---
$ govctl work new Original Title
Created work item: gov/work/<DATE>-original-title.toml
  ID: WI-<DATE>-001
exit: 0

$ govctl work edit WI-<DATE>-001 title --set New Title
Set WI-<DATE>-001.title = New Title
exit: 0

$ govctl work list all
┌───────────────────┬────────┬───────────┐
│ ID                ┆ Status ┆ Title     │
╞═══════════════════╪════════╪═══════════╡
│ WI-<DATE>-001 ┆ queue  ┆ New Title │
└───────────────────┴────────┴───────────┘
exit: 0
